decode-tta.js is an original JavaScript implementation (MIT, see LICENSE), written from the
TTA1 format and algorithm as described by the following BSD-licensed reference sources:

  ttadec.c, filter.h, ttadec.h, ttalib.h — TTAv1 decoder library
  Developed by: Alexander Djourik <ald@true-audio.com>
