The container/bitstream conventions actually emitted by `ffmpeg -c:a tta` were cross-checked
(read-only) against ffmpeg's libavcodec/tta.c, libavcodec/ttadata.c and libavformat/tta.c
(LGPL-2.1-or-later, Copyright (c) 2006 Alex Beregszaszi and FFmpeg contributors); no code from
